ce is via the back patio doors in Lot 43.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"im-east","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"IM East","title":"Check out IM East","subtitle":"804 E. Shaw Lane, east campus","notes":"If you have the required access, use the facility for a casual indoor activity; otherwise, use the exterior as a waypoint on the east-campus walk.","short_summary":"An east-campus recreation facility with courts, track, and fitness space.","evidence_claim":"MSU lists IM East’s indoor gym areas, racquetball and squash courts, volleyball courts, indoor track, and fitness room.","source_url":"https://recsports.msu.edu/facilities/im-east","source_title":"IM East | Recreational Sports and Fitness Services | Michigan State University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"IM East is membership-only; an MSU ID or Rec Sports access card is required, and guests and children are not permitted.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"east-lansing-farmers-market","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"East Lansing Farmers Market","title":"Close at the East Lansing Farmers Market","subtitle":"Valley Court Park, 280 Valley Court","notes":"On a Sunday market day, walk the vendor stalls, read the weekly shopping checklist, and buy only what you want to carry home.","short_summary":"A seasonal, growers-only market steps from campus and downtown.","evidence_claim":"The City of East Lansing says its growers-only market runs Sundays, June 7–October 25, 2026, from 10 a.m.–2 p.m. at Valley Court Park.","source_url":"https://www.cityofeastlansing.com/213/Farmers-Market","source_title":"Farmers Market | East Lansing, MI - Official Website","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"acces